`opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-proto-grpc`, `opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-proto-http`, `opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-json-http`, `opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-json-file`: deprecate the `_log_exporter` module in favor of `log_exporter`. `opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-proto-common`, `opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-json-common`: deprecate the `_log_encoder` module in favor of `log_encoder`
